        mbh:parvan "13_Anushasana" ;
        mbh:sourceSentenceIds "[11281, 11282, 11283, 11284, 11285, 11286, 11287]" ;
        mbh:sourceText """) Vachaspati;970 (530) Ayonija;971 (531) Trisama;972 (532) Samaga;973 (533) Sama; (534) Nirvana;974 (535) Bheshaja;975 (536) Bhishaka;976 (537) Sannyasa-kricchama;977 (538) Shanta;978 (539) Nishtha;979 (540) Shanti;980 (541) Parayanam;981 (542) Shubhanga;982 (543) Srashta;983 (544) Kumuda;984 (545) Kuvaleshaya;985 (546) Gohita;986 (.
) Gopati;987 (.
